  "assertions": [
    "Actual synthetic route change leaves the prior Avery share route in both journey state and the rendered read-only share-route field while Jordan is loaded; explicit dispatch on Jordan refreshes to Jordan and ignores forged payload identity fields.",
    "Same-profile alias retains the matching Avery route.",
    "Captured Sarah route uses the separate read-only renderer and does not inherit the synthetic share-route field or invoke the provider.",
    "Missing-profile result is unavailable and renders no share-route field on the error state.",
    "The held loading state omits the profile action panel; after Jordan resolves, the old Avery route reappears in the rendered share field.",
    "Anonymous supporter can prepare the local route for the viewed synthetic profile."
  ],
